# w3id.org/npfdo: np-FDO core specification and vocabulary
# Maintainer: Erik Schultes, https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8888-635X, GitHub @easchultes
# v0.1: all paths redirect to the specification repository; per-path rules follow once records are minted.
Options +FollowSymLinks
RewriteEngine on
RewriteRule ^(.*)$ https://github.com/easchultes/npfdo-core [R=302,L]
